(F5 T5 U10: group_beam_force_moment_plasti, elastic unloading. The
 propped cantilever of group_beam_force_moment_plasti1 (length 4, Mp 1,
 hinge at the fixed end from P 1.3333) is loaded to P 1.4, held, and
 unloaded to P 0. Unloading is elastic (propped cantilever stiffness), so
 the residual state is the plastic state at P 1.4 minus the elastic
 state at P 1.4:
 moment at the fixed end 1 - 3 P L / 16 = -0.05,
 moment under the load 0.9 - 5 P L / 32 = 0.025,
 deflection under the load -0.866667 + 0.816667 = -0.05,
 roller reaction -0.45 + 0.4375 = -0.0125 (node_rhside sign).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
node 3 2 0 0
node 4 3 0 0
node 5 4 0 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 2 3
element 3 -beam 3 4
element 4 -beam 4 5
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 1 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_force_moment_plasti 0  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_dof 1 -ra 2 5 -ra -velx -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_dof 2 5 -vely
bounda_force 3 3 -vely
bounda_time 3 0. 0. 14. -1.4 16. -1.4 30. 0. 100. 0.
control_timestep 10 1. 14.
control_timestep_iterations 10 20
control_timestep 20 1. 2.
control_timestep_iterations 20 20
control_timestep 30 1. 16.
control_timestep_iterations 30 20
target_item 0 -element_beam_force_moment 1 5
target_value 0 -0.05 1.e-8
target_item 1 -element_beam_force_moment 2 11
target_value 1 0.025 1.e-8
target_item 2 -node_dof 3 -disy
target_value 2 -0.05 1.e-8
target_item 3 -node_rhside 5 -vely
target_value 3 -0.0125 1.e-8
end_data
